    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "19. Attached Units",
    "ruleNumber": "19.01",
    "summary": "Units with a **[Leader](vsdata:core-ability/leader)** or **[Support](vsdata:core-ability/support)** ability (24.22, 24.34) are leader and support units. Either can lead other friendly units, called bodyguard units, to form an **attached unit**, which counts as one unit for every rule. Each may lead only the bodyguard units listed for it in the Warhammer app.",
